d47bae9b3d1c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This notebook provides a streamlined execution environment and \
comprehensive narrative guide for running the core GWPTools verification \
suite. ",
 "For the purposes of peer review, please note that the official, fully \
documented, and supported elements of this release are strictly limited to \
the core 1D engine, 1D hydrodynamics, and 1D phase space modules.",
 " The framework also contains several experimental extensions (such as the \
2D, Multi-Component, and Reduced Density Matrix engines) demonstrating the \
code\[CloseCurlyQuote]s extensibility; however, these remain in active beta \
development and are not covered by this formal testing suite.\n\nTo verify \
the package\[CloseCurlyQuote]s core integrity on your local machine, simply \
follow the annotated steps for the test files listed below or ",
 StyleBox["select Evaluate Notebook from the Evaluation menu",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ". Please note that to guarantee rigorous cross-platform reproducibility, \
this suite evaluates all complex symbolic logic and numerical integration \
constraints entirely from scratch. Consequently, ",
 StyleBox["execution will take approximately 10 to 15 minutes",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.988287889663212*^9, 3.9882879344154787`*^9}, {
   3.988288054016302*^9, 3.988288093480371*^9}, {3.9882881343524857`*^9, 
