   3.99747638759639*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a1f2fec7-16d1-4ce0-9af9-\
9c425216d339"],

Cell["\<\
The 1D-HYDRO-XSPACE test suite utilizes the previously established analytical \
functions to thoroughly verify the position-space representations of the \
system\[CloseCurlyQuote]s hydrodynamic properties. It systematically proves \
the mathematical accuracy of the amplitude and phase fields, the momentum and \
velocity vector fields, and the resulting current density. Furthermore, the \
tests validate the explicit analytical forms for the quantum potential, \
quantum force, and stress tensor, alongside the exact position-space \
information and energy densities.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.996756891973496*^9, {4.000410553256159*^9, 
   4.0004105626253357`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c6d6c32a-68c6-41ad-a114-\
8b2b54e74287"],

